 e.org.uk/event/black-history-month-2026-flower-making-workshop/
LOCATION:Oxford House\, Chapel\, Derbyshire Street\, Bethnal Green\, Lond
 on E2 6HG\, Bethnal Green\, London
URL:https://www.oxfordhouse.org.uk/event/black-history-month-2026-flower-
 making-workshop/
